to calculate $\delta_{n,\Fcal}$, where $\Bcal(\delta,\Fcal^*) := \{f\in\Fcal^*\mid \|f\|_2\leq \delta\}$, $N_n$ is the empirical covering number conditioned on $\{(x_i,z_i)\}_{i\in[n]}$.
